 <main id="content"><section class="site-video-hero"><video autoplay playsinline="" muted loop poster="./eligibility/hero_poster.jpg"><!----> <!----></video> <div class="site-video-hero__overlay"></div> <div class="site-video-hero__copy"><h1>
      Who is Eligible for CalFresh?
    </h1> <div class="red"><h2>
        CalFresh helps millions of California individuals, families, couples, college students, Veterans, and immigrant families. You may be eligible for CalFresh if you are a California resident and meet some core requirements.
      </h2> <!----></div></div></section> <section class="site-citizenship-section"><div class="container"><img src="./eligibility/salad.png" alt="Bowl of salad being tossed." class="display-mobile mobile-image-padding"> <h2 class="section-title">
    Citizenship
  </h2> <div class="site-citizenship-section__status"><div class="site-citizenship-section__status--copy"> <span class="display-desktop"><p>
          A household may be eligible for CalFresh if at least one member is: 
        </p> <ul class="calfresh-list"><li>A U.S. citizen</li><li>A lawful permanent resident (LPR) or is applying for LPR renewal</li></ul> <div class="site-citizenship-section__status--disclaimer"><p>Tip: Other types of immigrant statuses are eligible. Reach out to a <a href="https://calfresh.dss.ca.gov/food/officelocator/" target="_blank">County Eligibility Worker</a> to learn more.</p></div></span> <span class="display-mobile"><div class="site-citizenship-section__status--carousel base-carousel x-axis-overflow uses-scroll-snap" data-v-0fe04001><!----> <div class="carousel-x-axis-controls" data-v-0fe04001><!----> <div class="carousel-container" data-v-0fe04001><div class="eligibility-carousel-card"><h5 class="eligibility-carousel-card__question">
    A household may be eligible for CalFresh if at least one member is: 
  </h5> <!----> <ul class="calfresh-list"><li>
      A U.S. citizen
    </li><li>
      A lawful permanent resident (LPR) or is applying for LPR renewal
    </li></ul> <div class="eligibility-citizenship-section__status--disclaimer"><p>Tip: Other types of immigrant statuses are eligible. Reach out to a <a href="https://calfresh.dss.ca.gov/food/officelocator/" target="_blank">County Eligibility Worker</a> to learn more.</p></div></div><div class="eligibility-carousel-card"><h5 class="eligibility-carousel-card__question">
    What if people in my household have a different citizen or immigration status?
  </h5> <p>
    If you’re eligible for CalFresh but another member of your household isn’t, you can still apply for benefits.
  </p> <!----> <!----></div><div class="eligibility-carousel-card"><h5 class="eligibility-carousel-card__question">
    Will using CalFresh affect the immigration status of anyone in my household?
  </h5> <!----> <p>
      CalFresh does not affect immigration status or make you a public charge.
    </p> <!----></div></div> <div class="infinite-scroll-container" data-v-0fe04001></div> <!----> <!----></div>  <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-0fe04001></span></div></span></div> <div class="site-citizenship-section__status--image"><img src="./eligibility/salad.png" alt="Bowl of salad being tossed" class="display-desktop"></div></div> <div class="eligibility-citizenship-section__questions display-desktop"><div><h4 class="section-subtitle">
        What if people in my household have a different citizen or immigration status?
      </h4> <p>
        If you’re eligible for CalFresh but another member of your household isn’t, you can still apply for benefits.
      </p></div> <div><h4 class="section-subtitle">
        Will using CalFresh affect the immigration status of anyone in my household?
      </h4> <p>
          CalFresh does not affect immigration status or make you a public charge.
      </p></div></div></div></section> <section class="eligibility-income-section"><div class="container"><img src="./eligibility/bread-and-cheese.png" alt="Loaf of bread and slice of cheese"> <h2 class="section-title">
    Income
  </h2> <div class="eligibility-income-section__copy"><div><h4 class="section-subtitle">
        Your income limits are based on your household size.
      </h4> <ul class="calfresh-list"><li>Your “household” is the number of people you buy and share food with.</li><li>Certain expenses, like childcare, can be deducted to adjust your income.</li><li>If you need help calculating your income, reach out to a CalFresh expert at a <a href="https://calfresh.dss.ca.gov/food/officelocator/" target="_blank">CalFresh County Office</a>.</li></ul></div> <div><table><thead><tr><th>
              Household Size
            </th><th>
              Gross Monthly Income
            </th></tr></thead> <tbody><tr><td>
              1
            </td><td>
              $2,610
            </td></tr><tr><td>
              2
            </td><td>
              $3,526
            </td></tr><tr><td>
              3
            </td><td>
              $4,442
            </td></tr><tr><td>
              4
            </td><td>
