            </td></tr><tr><td>
              7
            </td><td>
              $8,110
            </td></tr><tr><td>
              8
            </td><td>
              $9,026
            </td></tr><tr><td>
              Each Additional Member
            </td><td>
              +$918
            </td></tr></tbody></table> <div class="eligibility-income-section__copy--disclaimer"><p><a href="https://cdss.ca.gov/Portals/9/Additional-Resources/Letters-and-Notices/ACINs/2025/I-46_25.pdf" target="_blank">CDSS Eligibility and Issuance Requirements</a><br>(Last updated September 2025)</p></div></div></div></div></section> <section class="eligibility-college-section"><div class="container"><div class="eligibility-college-section__image"><img src="./eligibility/ramen.png" alt="Ramen noodles with chopsticks"></div> <div class="eligibility-college-section__copy"><h2 class="section-title">
      Student Exemption
    </h2> <p>
      CalFresh is available for college students, too. If you’re a student, you may have an exemption that allows you to get CalFresh benefits to help pay for groceries.
    </p> <div><a data-gtm="learn-more" class="cta-button outline light" href="https://calfresh.dss.ca.gov/food/college/index.html"><span>
        Learn More
      </span> <!----></a></div></div></div></section></main> <footer class="layout-footer"><div class="layout-footer__top"><div class="layout-footer__top--logo"><img src="./logo.svg" alt="CalFresh Food logo"></div> <div class="layout-footer__top--links"><div><a href="https://www.facebook.com/CalFreshFood/" target="_blank" aria-label="Facebook link"><!----></a> <a href="https://www.instagram.com/calfreshfood/" target="_blank" aria-label="Instagram link"><!----></a> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@calfreshfood" target="_blank" aria-label="YouTube link"><!----></a></div> <div><a href="https://benefitscal.com/" target="_blank" data-gtm="apply-now" class="cta-button"><span>
          Apply Now
        </span> <!----></a></div></div></div> <div class="layout-footer__bottom"><div class="layout-footer__bottom--links"><div><a href="https://calfresh.dss.ca.gov/food/index.html" class="nuxt-link-active">
          Home
        </a></div> <div><a href="https://calfresh.dss.ca.gov/food/eligibility/index.html" aria-current="page" class="nuxt-link-exact-active nuxt-link-active">
